{"id":"costa","lemma":"costa","pos":"noun","rank":1206,"glosses":["coast, coastline","shore, shoreline"],"ipa":"/ˈkosta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"costas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-costa.wav","examples":[{"text":"Soy de la costa oeste.","en":"I'm from the West Coast.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582544"},{"text":"La Marina defiende nuestras costas.","en":"The navy defends our seacoast."},{"text":"Tom necesitaba dinero a toda costa.","en":"Tom badly needed money.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/353408"},{"text":"Él la salvó a costas de su vida propia.","en":"He saved her at the cost of his own life."},{"text":"La broma fue a costa de Tom.","en":"The joke is on Tom.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/799693"}]}